#: /var/www/html/admin/modules/dpviz/page.dpviz.php:239
#: /var/www/html/admin/modules/dpviz/views/toolbar.php:268
msgid "Time Conditions"
msgstr ""

#: /var/www/html/admin/modules/dpviz/page.dpviz.php:241
msgid ""
"A Time Condition pointed at a time group with no times defined no longer "
"throws an error. It now shows \"No times defined\" on the arrows and follows "
"No Match, which is what the dial plan actually does."
msgstr ""

#: /var/www/html/admin/modules/dpviz/page.dpviz.php:242
msgid ""
"Time Conditions that use a Calendar or Calendar Group now show the calendar "
"name on the Match and No Match arrows again."
msgstr ""

#: /var/www/html/admin/modules/dpviz/page.dpviz.php:243
msgid ""
"Those arrows are now colored green for the path a call takes right now and "
"red for the path it does not, the same way time group conditions already "
"behaved. They stay black only when the state cannot be determined, such as "
"when the Calendar module is disabled."
msgstr ""

#: /var/www/html/admin/modules/dpviz/page.dpviz.php:244
msgid ""
"Simulate Date & Time now evaluates calendars too, so you can check holiday "
"routing before the date arrives."
msgstr ""

